[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m There are zero `RETURN_ERROR`-equivalent branches, so there are zero
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m "function-returns-error-code" rows to write. Any row claiming otherwise would
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m be invented rather than derived, which the task forbids.
