[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     88[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Divergence found and fixed — rows E1 and E3
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     89[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     90[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The first fix for the misalignment problem used
